# Options

- **SQS**: fully managed AWS queue, with FIFO queues ordering within a message group.
- **Kafka (Amazon MSK)**: managed Kafka brokers with partitioned, replayable logs.
- **RabbitMQ (Amazon MQ)**: managed RabbitMQ brokers with flexible exchange routing.

# Comparison

table = Option,Ordering,Throughput ceiling,Ops burden,Replay,Monthly cost; SQS,FIFO per message group,very high,none,no,$310; Kafka,per partition,very high,high,yes up to retention,"$1,450"; RabbitMQ,per queue,medium,medium,no,$690

